    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Haley’s Hill, Malahide Road, Kinsealy | FINAL RELEASE OF TURNKEY 4-BEDROOM HOMES\r\nLaunching Saturday, 29th August, From 11AM – 1PM\r\n\r\nThese beautiful and spacious A-rated homes extend to approximately 141-142 sq.m (1,520-1,532 sq.ft.) and have been thoughtfully designed for modern family living, combining generous living space, exceptional energy efficiency and a premium turnkey specification.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned between Malahide and Portmarnock, Haley's Hill offers the perfect balance of coastal living and everyday convenience. Residents can enjoy easy access to excellent schools, sporting clubs, cafés, restaurants, beaches and transport links, all within minutes of home.\r\n\r\nHaley's Hill is now a well-established and thriving residential community, offering purchasers the opportunity to become part of an established neighbourhood with a strong sense of community.\r\n\r\nThis final release presents a rare opportunity to secure a premium family home, move in ready, within an established, sought-after community in one of North Dublin's most desirable residential locations.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today www.haleyshill.ie or contact us by phone or email."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Please refer to attached brochure for floor plans."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "These beautifully finished homes come complete with:\r\n•\tElegant herringbone flooring to the ground floor\r\n•\tCarpets fitted to stairs and first floor \r\n•\tContemporary designer kitchens with stone worktops\r\n•\tElectrolux appliance package, including double combi oven\r\n•\tSeparate utility room\r\n•\tAir-to-water heat pump heating system\r\n•\tA-rated BER for maximum energy efficiency\r\n•\tEV charging provision"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
